"""
REQ-001 behavior tests.

Tests are organized in three tiers:
1. Unit tests — port interface conformance, profile selection, parity validation
2. Integration tests (aws profile) — LocalStack-backed object storage round-trip
3. Integration tests (onprem profile) — MinIO-backed object storage round-trip

Integration tests require running infrastructure (LocalStack / MinIO) and are
marked with pytest markers so they can be selected or skipped.
"""

